# GREP_SUMMARY: grafana contact-points disabled no-receivers no-policies safe-default
# STRUCTURE: ▶ empty-contact-points + empty-policies → no-notifications → safe-default ┘
# region MODULE_CONTRACT
## @purpose  Safe default contact-points — no receivers, no notification policies. Grafana starts cleanly without Telegram env vars.
## @scope    ОТКЛЮЧЁННЫЙ вариант (не монтируется): активный канал — contact-points.yml (Telegram, DevPlan 140 W2 D-3)
## @invariants
##   - No contactPoints defined — safe when TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN is empty
##   - No notification policies — no routing to non-existent receivers
##   - alert-rules.yml still works (rules fire, but no notifications)
## @rationale Grafana 11.6.16 crashes at provisioning when contactPoints reference empty Telegram env vars
##           ("could not find Bot Token in settings"). Safe-default деактивирован 2026-08-06
##           (DevPlan 140 W2 D-3); хранится как откатный вариант. Чтобы вернуть safe-default:
##           поменять местами contact-points.yml и contact-points.yml.disabled, затем
##           docker compose restart grafana.
# endregion MODULE_CONTRACT

apiVersion: 1

# ⚠️ No contact points — Grafana starts cleanly without Telegram env vars.
contactPoints: []

# ⚠️ No notification policies — rules in alert-rules.yml fire but no notifications are sent.
policies: []
